 of the county&rsquo;s 4 grids, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 34% of normal and June to July at 186%. Grid 21173 had its driest year in 1963 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
